                                "sense_id": "457d469c-9e88-36ee-910e-94b69edfc1a5",
                                "text": "While delving microscopically through the pus in surgical bandages, Miescher found a substance he didn't recognize and called it nuclein (because it resided in the nuclei of cells)."
                            }
                        ]
